gard the rights of U. S. citizens?\" We can answer \"yes\" with citations: Chaplinsky v. New Hampshire (sentence 0) and Duncan v. Kahanamoku sentence 1 mentions Korematsu as Japanese exclusion cases regarding wartime curtailment of fundamental civil liberties. That indicates rights. Use that.\n\nThus answer: \"Yes\". Provide citations: [\"Chaplinsky v. New Hampshire\",0] and [\"Duncan v. Kahanamoku\",1]."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1565,"completion_tokens":523,"total_tokens":2088,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1791972097,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}